    <string name="gesture_trainer_how_corner">在屏幕<xliff:g id="corner">%2$s</xliff:g>角点按<xliff:g id="taps">%1$s</xliff:g>。将手指正好放在角落，距两条边缘都不超过 <xliff:g id="size">%3$d</xliff:g> 毫米，并快速抬起，在 <xliff:g id="time">%4$d</xliff:g> 毫秒内。</string>
    <string name="gesture_trainer_sizes"><xliff:g id="edge_setting">%1$s</xliff:g>：<xliff:g id="edge">%2$d</xliff:g> 毫米。<xliff:g id="corner_setting">%3$s</xliff:g>：<xliff:g id="corner">%4$d</xliff:g> 毫米。</string>
    <string name="gesture_trainer_corner_warning">角落越大，点按角落附近的控件（例如左上角的“返回”）时，越可能改为执行角落手势。</string>
